User operation to put a mark in the history list
Recent good ideas from graphic artists. October 12, 1990
Tools for finding out the color of a pixel (e.g., produced by a wash).
Box creation sized by selecting numbers.
Select multiple numbers at once to add to the Radius alignment menu.

High Priority -- Embarrassing Bugs

When you do Clear/Get/Restore and the picture is iconic, the backing maps are not invalidated and the old picture appears if you grow the icon.  Fix by changing the call to ViewerOps.PaintViewer in GGWindowImpl.RestoreScreenAndInvariants to call into GGRefresh instead.  Let GGRefresh do the work formerly done by implication by the paint proc. Requires and interface change. KAP March 24, 1989
When old files are read in, the alignment menus come up backwards. -- Bier, April 26, 1988
I'll fix this. -- Bier, August 19, 1988
The attractor feedback appears to over-write the selection feedback in some cases. -- ??? before August 19, 1988.

